---
import { BUSINESS_INFO } from '../../data/businessInfo';
---

<section class="py-14 lg:py-24 bg-zinc-50/60 border-b border-zinc-200/80">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-10 lg:gap-14 items-center">
      
      <!-- Left Column: Logistics Info (7 cols) -->
      <div class="lg:col-span-7 space-y-6">
        <div>
          <span class="text-xs font-semibold text-emerald-700 uppercase tracking-wider block mb-1">Jangkauan Logistik &amp; Instalasi</span>
          <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl lg:text-5xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-zinc-900 leading-[1.15]">
            Material Bisa Dikirim. Tim Kami Siap Datang.
          </h2>
        </div>

        <p class="text-sm sm:text-base text-zinc-600 leading-relaxed">
          Agrokomplek Cemerlang melayani kebutuhan material perkebunan dan instalasi greenhouse untuk berbagai wilayah di seluruh kepulauan Indonesia.
        </p>

        <!-- 2 Workflows (Apple Cards) -->
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-4 pt-2">
          <div class="rounded-3xl bg-white border border-zinc-200/80 p-6 shadow-xs space-y-2">
            <span class="text-xs font-semibold text-emerald-700 block">
              01 &mdash; Pengiriman Material
            </span>
            <p class="text-xs font-bold text-zinc-900">
              Plastik UV &bull; Paranet &bull; Mulsa &bull; Spring Clip &bull; Irigasi
            </p>
            <p class="text-xs text-zinc-500 leading-relaxed">
              Pengiriman melalui ekspedisi kargo rekanan terpercaya (darat &amp; laut) sesuai volume dan alamat tujuan Anda.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="rounded-3xl bg-white border border-zinc-200/80 p-6 shadow-xs space-y-2">
            <span class="text-xs font-semibold text-emerald-700 block">
              02 &mdash; Tim Instalasi Proyek
            </span>
            <p class="text-xs font-bold text-zinc-900">
              Jawa &bull; Sumatera &bull; Kalimantan &bull; Sulawesi
            </p>
            <p class="text-xs text-zinc-500 leading-relaxed">
              Untuk proyek greenhouse komersial, tim teknisi aplikator kami dapat dijadwalkan langsung ke lokasi lahan Anda.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Action Links (Pill Buttons) -->
        <div class="pt-2 flex flex-wrap gap-3">
          <a
            href="/wilayah-layanan/"
            class="px-6 py-3 rounded-full bg-zinc-900 hover:bg-zinc-800 text-white font-semibold text-xs tracking-normal transition-all shadow-xs select-none"
          >
            <span>Pelajari Jangkauan Layanan</span>
            <span aria-hidden="true">&rarr;</span>
          </a>
          <a
            href={`https://wa.me/${BUSINESS_INFO.contact.whatsappRaw}?text=${encodeURIComponent('Halo Agrokomplek Cemerlang, saya ingin cek ongkir material / layanan perakitan untuk lokasi proyek saya.')}`}
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer"
            class="px-6 py-3 rounded-full bg-white hover:bg-zinc-100 text-zinc-900 font-semibold text-xs border border-zinc-200/80 transition-all select-none shadow-2xs"
          >
            <span>Konsultasi Logistik WA</span>
            <span aria-hidden="true">&rarr;</span>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Right Column: Verification Data Box (5 cols) -->
      <div class="lg:col-span-5">
        <div class="rounded-3xl bg-white border border-zinc-200/80 p-6 sm:p-8 shadow-xs space-y-5">
          <h3 class="text-sm font-semibold text-zinc-900 uppercase tracking-wider border-b border-zinc-100 pb-3">
            Standar Pengemasan &amp; Pengiriman
          </h3>

          <div class="space-y-4 text-xs">
            <div class="space-y-1">
              <span class="font-semibold text-zinc-900 text-sm block">
                01 &mdash; Packing Ekstra Aman
              </span>
              <p class="text-zinc-500 leading-relaxed">
                Rol plastik UV dan material peka dikemas dengan perlindungan ganda untuk meminimalkan risiko goresan selama ekspedisi kargo.
              </p>
            </div>
            
            <div class="space-y-1">
              <span class="font-semibold text-zinc-900 text-sm block">
                02 &mdash; Resi Transparan &amp; Tracking
              </span>
              <p class="text-zinc-500 leading-relaxed">
                Foto bukti timbang dan nomor resi kargo resmi langsung dikirimkan via WhatsApp setelah serah terima ekspedisi.
              </p>
            </div>

            <div class="space-y-1">
              <span class="font-semibold text-zinc-900 text-sm block">
                03 &mdash; Panduan Teknis Pemasangan
              </span>
              <p class="text-zinc-500 leading-relaxed">
                Pelanggan yang merakit mandiri didukung sesi konsultasi teknis via WhatsApp dan video call oleh aplikator kami.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>
